WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:03.714
A coding agent sets up
internationalization,

2
00:00:03.714 --> 00:00:07.011
and a translation pipeline
keeps every language current as

3
00:00:07.011 --> 00:00:08.020
your app changes.

4
00:00:08.650 --> 00:00:12.586
General Translation translates
new and changed copy and reuses

5
00:00:12.586 --> 00:00:13.537
translations.

6
00:00:14.650 --> 00:00:16.519
With General Translation,

7
00:00:16.519 --> 00:00:21.035
Locadex prepares code changes and
translations in pull requests.

8
00:00:21.650 --> 00:00:23.484
You merge each pull request,

9
00:00:23.484 --> 00:00:25.168
or turn on Auto-merge,

10
00:00:25.168 --> 00:00:27.965
and reviewers check
translations in the Dashboard.

11
00:00:28.650 --> 00:00:34.676
In CI, npx gt translate translates
only new and changed content

12
00:00:34.676 --> 00:00:35.766
on every build.

13
00:00:36.150 --> 00:00:39.923
A Context Group gives your app
and docs the same Glossary and

14
00:00:39.923 --> 00:00:40.979
Custom Prompts.

15
00:00:41.650 --> 00:00:44.401
Your team now ships
Japanese with each release.
